d it was a people swarmed to  the stage and surrounded it like a holy  icon and you know when people think when  people say it it does this movie make  vermeer less of a great artist and you  look at their reaction to this painting  that this non painter has done just as a  scientific experiment you go know the  more you know about how how much goes  into a work of art the more you love it
 

